+# caches of the FP32 residual are not rounded/clamped to FP16 (+-65504). The
+# native H3 _forward gets its context cast back to FP16, so inner compute is
+# unchanged. The final audio/video head runs with FP32 modulation.
+# Set STAR7_FP32_CARRIER=0 to get the original upstream behaviour.
